-connectivity-and-weight-sharing","title":"$L39"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-is-a-convolution","title":"$L3a"},{"depth":2,"url":"#why-convolutions-work-so-well","title":"$L3b"},{"depth":2,"url":"#summary-3","title":"$L3c"},{"depth":1,"url":"#chapter-7-filters-features-and-the-power-of-convolutions","title":"$L3d"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-feature-detection-power-of-convolutions","title":"$L3e"},{"depth":2,"url":"#detecting-shapes-the-case-of-an-x","title":"$L3f"},{"depth":3,"url":"#convolution-mathematical-recap","title":"$L40"},{"depth":3,"url":"#interpretable-filters-and-hand-engineering","title":"$L41"},{"depth":3,"url":"#edge-detection-filters","title":"$L42"},{"depth":4,"url":"#horizontal-edge-filter-sobel","title":"$L43"},{"depth":4,"url":"#vertical-edge-filter-sobel","title":"$L44"},{"depth":3,"url":"#sharpen-filter","title":"$L45"},{"depth":3,"url":"#whats-learned-in-cnns","title":"$L46"},{"depth":3,"url":"#early-layers-typically-learn","title":"$L47"},{"depth":3,"url":"#deeper-layers-combine-these-to-form","title":"$L48"},{"depth":3,"url":"#summary-of-concepts","title":"$L49"},{"depth":1,"url":"#chapter-8-learning-to-see-understanding-the-inner-workings-of-cnns","title":"$L4a"},{"depth":2,"url":"#from-convolution-to-cnn-zooming-out","title":"$L4b"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-core-components-of-a-cnn","title":"$L4c"},{"depth":3,"url":"#i-convolution","title":"$L4d"},{"depth":3,"url":"#ii-relu-nonlinearity-eg-relu-rectified-linear-unit","title":"$L4e"},{"depth":3,"url":"#iii-pooling-downsampling","title":"$L4f"},{"depth":2,"url":"#local-connectivity--hierarchical-features","title":"$L50"},{"depth":2,"url":"#multiple-filters-per-layer--feature-volume","title":"$L51"},{"depth":2,"url":"#training-how-filters-are-learned","title":"$L52"},{"depth":2,"url":"#visualizing-filters","title":"$L53"},{"depth":2,"url":"#classification-via-softmax","title":"$L54"},{"depth":3,"url":"#softmax-formula","title":"$L55"},{"depth":3,"url":"#this-ensures","title":"$L56"},{"depth":3,"url":"